{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30363","headline":"李侍御归山同宿华严寺 · 赵嘏","name":"李侍御归山同宿华严寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家有青山近玉京，风流柱史早知名。\n园林手植自含绿，霄汉眼看当去程。\n处处白云迷驻马，家家红树近流莺。\n相逢一宿最高寺，夜夜翠微泉落声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}